{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awaken the memories of a forgotten world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sleeping Dragon</strong> is a cozy puzzle adventure set in vibrant diorama levels, blending the whimsical charm of animes with clean, low-poly aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong>Hiru</strong>, a young traveler lost in the Dream Lands. To find your way home, you must explore the realm of the Great <strong>Sleeping Dragon</strong>. With the guidance of your quirky companion, the <strong>Cuckoo Clock-Birdie</strong>, you\u2019ll navigate floating islands, solve perspective-based puzzles, and recover the 7 sacred totems that hold the dragon\u2019s lost memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why does the Dragon sleep? And what secrets do its memories hold?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Dioramas:</strong> Explore intricate 3D worlds filled with secrets hidden around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whimsical Art Style:</strong> A relaxing visual experience inspired by classic anime aesthetics and cozy vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile Puzzles:</strong> Rotate the environment and interact with the world to find hidden paths and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Journey:</strong> Experience a stress-free adventure focused on exploration, discovery, and atmosphere.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1551680?t=1767991956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1551680?t=1767991956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767991956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1551680/capsu